4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Intricate_Field_Optics_(Level_13).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Intricate_Field_Optics_%28Level_13%29.png/420px-Intricate_Field_Optics_%28Level_13%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"306\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Intricate_Field_Optics_%28Level_13%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>These field optics are of too precise a workmanship for the ancient giants to have created them. They must have been assembled by elven artisans in the presence of a giant master.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817045514\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.082 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.128 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3221/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 22660/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5924/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n123.29%  135.701     44 Template:IO\n100.00%  110.064      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  110.064      1 -total\n 95.56%  105.178      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 41.11%   45.248      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 40.36%   44.424      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 39.56%   43.542      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 38.69%   